div.p:
The total number of deployed ICBMs and their
                    associated launchers, deployed SLBMs and their
                    associated launchers and heavy bombers will be reduced to no more than 1600;
                    within this total deployed heavy ICBMs and
                    their associated launchers will be reduced to no more than 154;

Reductions will be carried out in three phases over a period of seven years.
                    Specific. Equal interim levels for agreed categories of strategic offensive arms
                    will be achieved by the end of each phase of reductions;
